EnergyCommunity.user.mobileApp

Scope & Responsibilities:
- Encapsulates mobile client actor business logic and device-level integrations for community members.
- Manages user-side workflows: live consumption tracking, geofencing triggers (e.g. proximity-based energy reservation for EV charging), and review of AI-generated optimization proposals.

Component Boundaries & Visibility:
- VISIBILITY: CLIENT APPLICATION.
- Boundary Rule: Acts as an external consumer of the backend, communicating strictly through contracts exposed by core.api. Captures user decisions (Accept/Reject) and forwards them via public API endpoints.
